{"availability":"available","full":"VarshaThondalapally/shiftmemory-cognee-hackathon","name":"shiftmemory-cognee-hackathon","description":"Source-grounded team-memory demo using Cognee, Gemini, FastAPI, React, role-based access, and verified remember/recall/forget lifecycle controls.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-05T00:32:37Z","updated":"2026-09-03T22:04:01Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://varshathondalapally.github.io/shiftmemory-cognee-hackathon/","topics":["access-control","applied-ai","cognee","fastapi","gemini","human-in-the-loop","rag","react"],"demo":"https://varshathondalapally.github.io/shiftmemory-cognee-hackathon/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:30.590Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:30.590Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:30.590Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:40:05.674Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T03:01:30.590Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A caregiver finishes a night shift. They leave a few small but important notes: family asked for an update, the resident was restless, breakfast preference changed, and one old note is wrong.","Morning staff opens the app and clicks one button. The app generates a clean handoff from remembered notes, cites the source notes, lets a supervisor prioritize important information, and removes stale notes from future answers.","That is the hackathon use case: a memory-backed handoff assistant for teams where missing one small note creates confusion in the next shift."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VarshaThondalapally/shiftmemory-cognee-hackathon/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a8571c675fa6849709da17a18d83ea17c6e128602b6e6076a530272354a40b84","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:05.867Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:05.867Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A caregiver finishes